4	 * Key design decisions:
5	 * - persist middleware handles serialization lifecycle; custom debounced storage adapter rate-limits writes
6	 * - skipHydration: true for Next.js SSR safety (call rehydrate() in useEffect)
7	 * - partialize excludes action functions from persistence
8	 * - Structured artifacts use ArtifactRecord with version history (undo/redo)
9	 * - Semiformal/lean kept as flat strings for pipeline compatibility
10	 * - Streaming preview state stays outside this store (keep transient state local)
11	 *
12	 * See docs/decisions/005-zustand-state-management.md for rationale.
13	 */
